WEBVTT

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Well, hopefully she comes on.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah. How's your day going?

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Carmen Cruickshank: We'll see.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Pause it real quick, one second. Where is my…

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Let's see…

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I have to, like, sign into my Zoom again and everything.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Whitney Hodges: Oh.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, but I mean, so far it's pretty good, just kind of, like, catching up on things. Sometimes I'll have, like, an agency-heavy day, and sometimes I'll have, like, an extra day, so… yeah.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm, yeah.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Tomorrow's definitely gonna be agency heavy, with, like, prepping for the call on Friday, and then also working on Dogwood, so…

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:59.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm. Yeah. Yeah, I can tell they're very, like, anxious to just, like, get ads running immediately.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, they were definitely excited about it.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Uh, let's see…

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Oh, there it is. Okay, pause.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Whitney Hodges: Oh, yeah, for sure.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Whitney Hodges: um…

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.000
Carmen Cruickshank: How about you? How was the sales call?

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:39.000
Whitney Hodges: It was really good. It was long. Like, it was only supposed to be 30 minutes, and it was, like, a full hour. Um… and, um…

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Thank you.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:46.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah, they're interested in Elevate, like, doing everything. So, the way I've been selling that lately is, like.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:54.000
Whitney Hodges: It's kind of painstaking. I have, like, a discovery call, and then I have an Elevate demo call, and so…

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:03.000
Whitney Hodges: the discovery call is kind of to, like, pre-sell them sort of thing, like, make sure it's actually a fit. Um, and then…

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:13.000
Whitney Hodges: the demo call is more like, I'm, like, showing them what Google Ads look like, showing them what Meta Ads look like, showing an example of a landing page, then, um…

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:18.000
Whitney Hodges: Showing them inside LeadLock how everything looks as well.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm. That's cool.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:32.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm. Yeah. But the only thing I don't, like, love about it is, uh, they are elopement photographers and videographers, like an elopement photo and video team sort of thing.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:36.000
Whitney Hodges: Um, and I think I'm just having, like.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:44.000
Whitney Hodges: PTSD from, like, Dave, you know? Like, I feel like the photographers and videographers are just…

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:51.000
Whitney Hodges: Can be kind of tough to work with, and they like to have, like, creative control, but then they don't.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:55.000
Whitney Hodges: do the stuff that they're, like, ultimately supposed to do.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:59.000
Whitney Hodges: Oh, I see the message from Bri.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.000
Whitney Hodges: Mm-hmm.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah. Mm-hmm.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:18.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah, I think just send her the link, the strategy, you know, our link, the one, the right one, you know?

